      <li><i><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8"/><path d="M12 8v4l3 2"/></svg></i><span><b>Cancel any time</b>Something wrong? Stop it before it lands. Alerts by Telegram or email.</span></li>
